        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submerse yourself and explore the underwater world as a fish! Play as one of many saltwater fish species, as you navigate through shallow grass flats or pelagic depths. You'll need to hunt and eat other smaller fish to grow and unlock new species. But watch out danger lurks in the distance and around every structure! Start the game as a Mangrove Snapper, explore the world with its many wrecks and underwater structures. Keep your distance from larger predators or end up as dinner. While avoiding danger eat smaller fish to earn bones and use them to unlock the next species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now explore in a new way with the new mode &quot;Hook N' Line&quot; </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submerse yourself and explore the underwater world as a fish! Play as one of many saltwater fish species, as you navigate through shallow grass flats or pelagic depths. You'll need to hunt and eat other smaller fish to grow and unlock new species. But watch out danger lurks in the distance and around every structure! Start the game as a Mangrove Snapper, explore the world with its many wrecks and underwater structures. Keep your distance from larger predators or end up as dinner. While avoiding danger eat smaller fish to earn bones and use them to unlock the next species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now explore in a new way with the new mode &quot;Hook N' Line&quot; </p>",
        "short_description": "An underwater arcade survival game where you eat and grow to climb up the food chain Or play in the new fishing mode unlock new boats buy new lures fish and spearfish with the new Hook N' Line mode",
